# SIZE AND COMPLEXITY LIMITS

> Full doc: `{rules_dir}/00-core/size-and-complexity-limits.md`

## Hard caps

| Metric | Cap |
|--------|-----|
| Function / method lines | **waived** (no file/function line gate) |
| File / module lines | **waived** |
| Cyclomatic complexity | **≤ 10 per function** |

## Before marking work done

1. Run typecheck + lint (or project equivalent).
2. Keep cyclomatic ≤ 10 — extract when approaching 8.
3. Prefer clarity over artificial splits for line count.

## Agent NEVER

- Ship cyclomatic > 10 without explicit user waiver.
- Nest deeper to game complexity — extract functions instead.
